WEBVTT

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:13.810
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.290
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:21.440
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:27.880
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:45.900
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy,
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:33.460
Episode 6
Further Into Darkness

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.370
What do you want with me?

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.650
We want to unite the three 
girls' classes into one.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:36.550
Then, we want to unite the whole school.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:40.500
Even if you're not student 
council president anymore,

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.600
you still have lots of 
influence in class nineteen.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.470
Well? Want to work with us?

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.800
Foolishness.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.000
I don't have time to play 
along with your game.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.810
Come on, at least think 
about it a little first!

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.870
And if you join us...

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:03.950
Hey... Calm down a little.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.780
If anything happens to me,

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.920
you'll be in big trouble.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.050
You're dead either way.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.170
I'm just speeding things up a bit.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.390
Talk!

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.390
Where is Jun's cell phone?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.390
Let him go.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:27.880
To lay a hand on me...

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.100
You want to die, do you?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.300
This my bodyguard.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.600
I have permission from the headmistress, too.

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.550
Let me warn you...

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.980
When I die isn't for you to decide.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.280
You son of a...

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.630
Instructor Ryo.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.900
I want to avoid trouble, too.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.960
I just want to live freely.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.300
I don't have Jun's cell phone—

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.130
Shut up!

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.450
Bring it out at once!

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:55.180
Calm down.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:58.970
My disobedient dog ran off 
with it in his mouth.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.130
If Shin's information is right,

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.970
this should be the place...

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.490
But no one's here.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.650
Did I get the wrong place?

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:12.480
Hanging around here alone takes real guts.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.610
We saw you running around last night.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:20.980
Wonder how well he'll run 
after we break his legs.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.370
<i>Once we take out Hibiki,</i>

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.390
<i>we can finish off the 
trash in class four, too.</i>

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.010
<i>Once Wudo gets out,</i>

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:31.960
<i>I'll make him call </i>me<i> "Big Bro."</i>

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.900
You should probably lay off.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.210
Stay out of my way.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.970
If you don't, I won't show any mercy.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.520
You sure are an idiot.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.520
Do you not realize the position you're in?

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.960
It's not really the time to act like a tough guy.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:54.680
You insist on going against me, then?

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.980
You won't get off easily.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.480
What?!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.990
Bear the current time in mind.

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:15.710
Hey, what are you doing?

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.190
You want to hit me, right?

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:20.560
So I'm hitting myself.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:23.520
This guy's gone crazy!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.800
You think he's gone crazy from terror?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.520
I've never seen a guy beat 
the crap out of himself...

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.450
Keep it up!

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.490
Go on, beat yourself to death!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.460
Well, we'd better get started.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.500
We'll start with the dining hall.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.760
Yeah, let's finish it up, then take a nap.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.340
Babysitting these brats is exhausting.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.740
No kidding!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.950
What are those?

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.910
If you join us,

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.750
you can have all the cell phone 
and Internet usage you want.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.850
Then you can even talk 
to your little brother!

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.800
How do you know about my little brother?

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.460
I can find out stuff like that, easy.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:09.000
I hacked into the school database 
and looked up your profile.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.330
And I accessed your family register
 using the police data system, too.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.120
Your parents are dead.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.020
Your little brother doesn't go to school.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:20.490
So it seems to me that
 he must be in the hospital!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.720
And I found your eleven-year-old brother Shu

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:27.440
checked in at First Central Hospital's 
coronary care ward, room 13, 8th floor.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.980
So I guess I was right!

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.300
I see.

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:34.780
You can access the Internet, 
and you can hack.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.460
If you want me to join you, 
give me a cell phone.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.320
No need to rush!

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.960
This is the only one I have right now.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:44.610
It's a device I modified personally.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.460
Never mind.

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.120
If you won't give me a cell phone, 
this conversation is over.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.480
Wait! Gosh, you're so stingy.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.490
Using this,

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:57.460
I can find location information on 
cell phones connected to the Internet.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.210
Every day around noon and at night,

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.410
multiple cell phones gather 
in one single place.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.490
You know where the cell phones are?

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:06.690
Yep!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.240
If we go after one person alone,

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.950
we can work together to get their cell phone!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.260
Are you done already?

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:19.980
It was a pretty fun show.

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:20.960
You should keep it up.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.970
Wh-What?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.290
Wh-What the hell is he doing?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:36.970
I don't know.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.500
Hit me as much as you want!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.260
I won't fold, even if you kill me!

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:50.480
I won't break rules by smuggling cell phones!

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.600
You're the ones who hit me first!

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.950
No matter how much you 
hit me, I'll never fold!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.850
Even if you beat me to death...

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.960
I'll never betray Head Instructor Shian!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.660
This guy set us up!

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.880
Head Instructor Shian!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:05.890
Let's get going!

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:11.610
H-Head Instructor Shian! I...

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.310
What are you all doing here?

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.470
W-We...

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.000
Head Instructor Shian!

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.500
I didn't give in!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.480
Instructor, i-it's not what it looks like!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.500
He's lying!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.540
W-We didn't hit him!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:33.020
Causing trouble every day...

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.940
Do you want to be hit that badly?

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.960
Take the ringleader, Kon, 
for three days in solitary.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.150
The rest of you, no meals today.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.900
You can think about what you 
did over empty stomachs.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.470
Are you kidding me? No meals?

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:48.570
Damn, what a dirty trick.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.250
I can't believe we fell for that.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.290
He hit himself so much...

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.600
He must be nuts.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.330
What'll we do?

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:56.300
He might go after us next time.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.600
Don't worry.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.980
My target is gone.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:04.400
I have no grudge against the rest of you.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.980
Only a small portion of people are at fault.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.200
The rest of you are just suffering 
prisoners in this school, right?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.200
We should help each other.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.950
If you like, I'll treat 
you to dinner tonight.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.000
Meat dishes.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.960
Yes, please!

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.700
Feed us!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.700
I want to eat meat!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:32.970
Yes, please!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.470
Well?

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.600
Want to see if there really 
are cell phones there?

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.800
Time is money!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.480
Let's go steal a cell phone together!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.480
Input Password

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.480
Fine.

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.540
I'll see it with my own eyes,

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.280
and decide based on that if I'll join you.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.690
Yeah! I'm so glad you agree!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.200
Let's work together, Shiori-chan!

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.490
Ban.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.460
It's time to get going.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.420
By the way, where do the 
class six people do business?

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:12.560
Class six?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.470
Behind the dorm and in 
the second class building.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.750
<i>That's strange...</i>

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:20.470
<i>Shin said it was the dining hall.</i>

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.210
U-Um, you probably shouldn't 
go looking for those guys.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:24.900
Why not?

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.220
It's best not to upset the class six guys.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:27.950
Yeah!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.900
Their leader, Yoh, is really, really tough.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.270
Their homeroom instructor is even worse.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.980
You really shouldn't make them mad.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:39.460
<i>Are they saying there's an instructor 
worse than Shian out there?</i>

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.610
Also...

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:45.450
we got information that 
you'd be here around noon.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:50.000
I don't know who spread the rumor.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:52.650
But you'd better be careful.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:56.470
You need to find every student with a 
hidden cell phone and report them to him.

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:56.470
I bought a few upgrades, that's all.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.750
If you do, you'll earn his trust,

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:59.970
Well? Want to live with me?

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.980
and the other students will
 acknowledge your superiority.

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.440
Hibiki-chan, you're so stupid.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.440
<i>Can it be...</i>

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:13.650
Shiori?

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.510
Hibiki...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.010
Hibiki...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.000
Wow, what a hottie!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.150
Just my type!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.150
Hey, who are you?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.420
Stop it! Stay back!

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.410
You're great!

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:57.750
Let me hug you!

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:57.750
What are you doing?

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:58.440
Get off of me!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.860
It must be destiny that we've met!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.700
Darling!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.970
Please, hold me in your arms!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.970
Are you crazy or something?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:06.030
Someone help me!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.740
No need to be bashful!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:10.690
Look, we even have the same cowlick!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.300
What are you even talking about?

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:16.130
Is your "big sister" all right?

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.870
She's just a bit desperate for love.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:20.760
Come on, let's have a little fun!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.810
No! Get off of me!

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:22.410
Stop that!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.480
That hurts!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:24.490
Enough!

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.090
Are you Hibiki?

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:30.100
You have the cell phones 
Wudo was smuggling, right?

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:32.350
We know everything.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:34.520
Hand over the cell phones.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.520
If you don't, I'll give you a pounding.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.210
Did you hear that?

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:39.970
That woman thinks she's hot stuff.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.540
Give him a pounding?

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:42.820
Sounds fun.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.020
I'd love to see it.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.030
Give us a real good time!

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.540
Akane, really! Stop being so lovesick!

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:50.930
Jeez!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.490
You want to rule the school, don't you?

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:53.900
Is this really appropriate?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.300
That's right!

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.380
Pony up all the cell phones!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.480
Then I'll let you join my gang.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:02.050
Enough joking.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:04.540
I'm sorry.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.790
You are terribly charming,

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.740
but it wasn't meant to be.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.010
Pity though it is...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:14.440
So handsome!

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:19.540
That girl's nuts or something.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.030
Well? Why not play with us instead?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:30.540
Now you've done it... Get her!

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:36.540
You bitch!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.200
Shiori...

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.360
Well?

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:52.890
If you do as we say, 
you can avoid a pointless fight.

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.020
Right?

00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:56.090
Shiori.

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:58.590
I'm sorry for getting you 
mixed up in that before.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.070
But things are different now.

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:02.020
You won't be teased anymore.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.690
I got a cell phone, too.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:08.020
When did I ask for your protection?

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:10.400
Hand over the cell phone and get lost.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.030
I'm here with Akane.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.690
Shiori... you...

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.540
Quit stalling and hand it over.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.880
Come on.

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.780
Or will I have to strip search you?

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:21.050
Let me do it! Please!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:30.220
You shouldn't tease a dog 
until you know its master.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.220
Who are you?

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:37.010
Shin...

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:38.960
Perfect timing.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.220
We need to settle things from before.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:44.400
That cell phone you gave me 
doesn't get any signal.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.940
Giving me a broken piece of trash...

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.160
You're absolutely disgusting.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:51.680
What?

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:53.450
Shin, what's she talking about?

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:56.470
So you all know each other, eh?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.410
In that case...

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.040
I'll finish you all off at once!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:04.360
Hey, Shiori. Are you stupid?

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:07.060
You're going to attack me 
without knowing the situation?

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.700
The school blocks radio waves.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.620
Cell phones don't get any signal,

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.300
and you need a password to use the Internet.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:16.090
It's pretty obvious.

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.520
The rest of you need to calm down, too.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.810
I think you've all heard this by now...

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.330
He's only been here a few days,

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:29.020
yet he deposed Wudo this morning.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:31.810
And one more warning:

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:33.530
he's my dog.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:37.220
If you join me, 
I'll make sure you won't regret it.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:41.690
If you defy me, 
you could become the next Wudo.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.070
If you're as smart as you act,

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.410
I won't have to say any more, will I?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.260
Oh, God!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.710
How lucky must I be today?

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.050
Another man's here who's just my type!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.520
Shiori, I think we've had 
a small misunderstanding.

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.300
But it's true that Shin is the 
strongest guy in the school...

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.360
Shut up!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:03.780
Well...

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.860
I see you're good at 
wagging your tail, at least.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.890
It's giving me goosebumps.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:08.860
Hibiki.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.560
You really are hopeless.

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:13.370
After becoming Shin's dog...

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.370
don't you dare talk down to me!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:18.380
N-No...

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:20.000
I wasn't.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:21.870
I...

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:22.690
Enough.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.030
Garbage master and his garbage dog...

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.210
Dig in deep!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.520
I'm about to beat the hell out of you!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.150
Run away!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.400
You damn dog!

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.490
You won't escape!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:15.180
Hiding in the boys' bathroom...

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.000
What is this, kindergarten?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.360
What a laugh!

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.200
We'll kill you!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.750
We'll strip you naked!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.020
Enough.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:30.940
Cooled off a bit now, have you?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.860
I didn't want to solve this with violence.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.340
But if that's what you bring to me,

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:37.720
I'll meet you blow for blow.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.880
Can we have a proper discourse now?

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.450
With that many people?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.380
Looks like a fight to me!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.380
You're nothing but talk.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.850
S-So strong...

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:33.040
I didn't want to get rough with a woman,

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.960
but since you won't learn your place

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.490
I had to resort to this.

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:42.520
Shin. Why are they doing this?

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:48.000
Oh, they're your new comrades.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:51.020
Yoh, leader of class six.

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:53.490
Ban, of class twenty.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.980
What?

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.130
Yoh of class six?

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.030
You told me to find him...

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.360
I did.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:06.190
I intended to leave class six to you.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:09.550
But Yoh is smart, so he came to me.

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:12.550
What's wrong with allying 
myself with someone strong?

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:14.040
What did you say?

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:19.900
Yet it seems you abandoned 
the mission I gave you

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.560
for playtime with the girls.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.340
Th-That's not true...

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.010
I did exactly as you said...

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.620
Hey, let go of them!

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:40.840
I told you.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:46.500
All who defy me will have a bad time.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.060
Hey, Hibiki.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.810
You really disappointed me this time,

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:53.790
so I'll give you just one more chance.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:56.800
What are you doing?

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.540
Strip their clothes off

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:01.540
and take naked pictures of them!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.410
The next time they defy me,

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.620
I'll send the pictures out to the school!

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:08.520
But...

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:11.000
Go on, get started.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.400
What are you talking about?

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.570
This is ridiculous!

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.240
Doing something like that to a girl?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.020
You—

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.030
Hibiki, I can't believe you.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.910
I thought you were a loyal dog,

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.690
but you can't even handle one little test?

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.810
Refusing your master's orders...

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:40.400
Though actually, this is the 
second time you've defied me.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:45.180
You thought I didn't know?

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.500
You haven't done it with Shiori yet.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.970
No. I...

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:56.190
If Shiori was your woman already,

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:59.020
she wouldn't be acting the way she is now.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.440
If you don't even realize that,

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:05.010
you really are a hopeless idiot.

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.170
You...

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.020
Listen.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.050
This is your final chance.

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:13.040
Take the naked pictures.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.540
If you won't be my dog,

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:19.120
you'll be my enemy.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.610
Choose which one you prefer.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.640
I...

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.990
I'll just take one.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.040
Will that do?

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.540
Fine.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:28.930
Hibiki.

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.480
Today, I am reborn.

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:32.810
You hopeless piece of garbage.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:34.280
I don't care if it costs my life.

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:34.780
You think you can protect a woman?

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:36.470
I don't care if I have to sell my soul!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 7
A Decision at Rock Bottom

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:36.460
It's your fault!

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:39.320
Why would I swear loyalty 
to someone like you?!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.980
I have only one goal.
